  "contentPreview": "WHAT IS ACTUALLY ESTABLISHED about scri\u0027s latency (corrected 2026-08-21).  SOLID \u2014 in-process, BenchmarkDotNet, controlled conditions: HintReadPathBenchmarks reports the hint read path at 50.4us / 50 entries, 336us / 250, 1,152us / 1,000. At this repo\u0027s 69 memories the search costs about 0.07ms. Independently corroborated: an EMPTY workspace measures the same wall-clock as the 69-memory one, so the corpus contributes nothing detectable. There is no \u0027unmeasured ~58ms search half\u0027 \u2014 optimising ret",
